%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A11_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "That long?? I do feel well rested but isn\u2019t that considered a coma?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "You must be hungry. My manager is making food for us right now. Oh, and
      in case you were wondering: This is one of my residences that hasn\u2019t been
      affected by the earthquake."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh. How did we get here?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I follow Aleph into the kitchen and he answers while we walk.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My manager lives nearby. After the phone call we had back then, he wanted
      to prepare this place for us to live in and found us laying in the garden out
      front.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So I managed to shift us back here. Fortunately.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes. On that note, thank you for saving my life.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I couldn\u2019t have done it without your support."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We arrive in the kitchen and there is a middle-aged man setting the dining
      table.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This is James, my manager. He knows about me not being from here too.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh my, hello {playerName}. It\u2019s very nice to meet you. I\u2019ve
      heard a lot about you."
    alternativeText: "Oh my, hello. It\u2019s very nice to meet you. I\u2019ve heard
      a lot about you."
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62e84d2ec46b1f44d8a2b8c9e355591d, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hello James, nice to meet you too. And thank you for making food.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Now that the smell of food is hitting me, I can feel how hungry I am. I
      almost start drooling.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I guess that can happen when you don\u2019t eat anything in two days."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We all sit down and have a meal together while chatting about how James
      and Aleph got to know each other and how James helped Aleph with becoming a
      professional singer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Turns out, that James had lost his son many years ago and Aleph reminded
      him of his son. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: James must have had his parental instincts kick in.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "We also talk about what happened in Aleph\u2019s dimension as well and
      the topic moves to me having powers to shift and being the successor of the
      Sustainer."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I think you should experiment with your powers a bit and train them. James
      and I will support you here. There are amenities like a pool, private basketball
      court or track field that we can use as your training ground.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I remember how I almost broke down while running away from John and realise,
      that I might be on the weaker side when it comes to strength and stamina.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s not a bad idea actually. While I train my powers I can also
      work on my physical strength by working out."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m not sure if I will still have motivation after a few days though."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sounds good, but remember not to overdo it. Health is the most important
      thing.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62e84d2ec46b1f44d8a2b8c9e355591d, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Don\u2019t worry James, I will take good care of {playerName}. We can
      be training buddies. I really hope you will be able to control all your power."
    alternativeText: "Don\u2019t worry James, I will take good care of them. We can
      be training buddies. I really hope you will be able to control all your power."
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That would really be helpful, especially if we end up in a similar situation
      like last time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Wait, did he say he\u2019ll train with me?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I look out the window while Aleph continues to say something. But I can\u2019t
      hear him because I\u2019m distracted with my thoughts. The weather is hot and
      humid since it\u2019s summertime."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That means\u2026 I might be able to see\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e6d245d606423614b9b3f09975142dfd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00fee4105f4015b4a96e3a993b39d554, type: 2}
